      "content": "A visit with `drawer=price-history\u0026session=...\u0026replay=open` leaves this arrival pending until the overlay closes. If the user chooses Position or Journal in that overlay, this effect then issues a second Price History request, overriding the user's drawer selection and focus on the next render. Cancel the pending arrival when an explicit drawer request is made (and add a test starting with all three address parameters).",
