    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/trade-detail/Cockpit.tsx",
      "content": "`initialSession` comes directly from the URL without validation. Interpolating it into a CSS selector means a pasted address with a quote or backslash in `session` can cause `querySelector` in the focus effect to throw a SyntaxError, rather than gracefully handling a session with no column. Validate the date or escape the attribute value with `CSS.escape` before constructing the selector.",
